            "pages": {
              "end": 30,
              "start": 30
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia asked if the federal government may do anything the states choose not to do."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7f9c90f69995f5bc79e01c3baa3066c820a42f4edeaa1e8cfdf61a7635165175",
