            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 81,
              "start": 81
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Sotomayor asked whether individual states could enact their own insurance mandates."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7f9c90f69995f5bc79e01c3baa3066c820a42f4edeaa1e8cfdf61a7635165175",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-7f9c90f69995-0004-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 87,
              "start": 87
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Breyer, justice Breyer requested a yes\u2011or\u2011no answer to the question of state mandates."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7f9c90f69995f5bc79e01c3baa3066c820a42f4edeaa1e8cfdf61a7635165175",
